  <item>
    <title>Vol.3看大戏 | 深度解密《解密》——最爱你的人是我，你怎么舍得我难过！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66b0e6f77349f7a557f22456</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66b0e6f77349f7a557f22456</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 05 Aug 2024 14:51:34 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>强烈建议看过电影后再来收听，这次节目的时长跟一部电影的时长一样。</span></p><span></span><p><span>也可也尝试一边看电影一边收听本期节目，前半部分像拉片，后半部分在争论谁最爱陈导。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="280">04:40</a> 吃饭那场戏的代入感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="470">07:50</a> 开场采访段落的感受</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="610">10:10</a> 小黎黎来找容金珍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="699">11:39</a> 如果我们拍容金珍被小黎黎带走的这场戏</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="885">14:45</a> 《心灵捕手》的人物设置</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1065">17:45</a> 重复的笔墨讲容金珍的天赋</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1080">18:00</a> 希伊斯教授生擒容金珍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1172">19:32</a> 《心灵捕手》的类似设置</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1280">21:20</a> 关于“国”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1535">25:35</a> 原著小说里是如何体现关爱的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1650">27:30</a> 浪费了一场好戏</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1740">29:00</a> 可以合二为一的两场戏</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1810">30:10</a> &nbsp;中弹的人不救了吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2250">37:30</a> 容金珍和两个女人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2745">45:45</a> 关于梦境</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3210">53:30</a> 最喜欢的一场梦&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3525">58:45</a> 关于主题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3680">01:01:20</a> 一屋子的鲜花</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4100">01:08:20</a> 最好的转场</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4150">01:09:10</a> 关于真诚与否</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4370">01:12:50</a> 陈导之路</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5015">01:23:35</a> 这次的表达和以往的表达</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/liIDg46s0DARmZ7sHq-WXwGsTxLz.m4a" length="134320185" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:32:33</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpjKGpPwimoG__d29-vRks6UaiAZ.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
